+        "principal norm identity; without recognizing it, the paper's relation "
+        "evaluation ranges over every sign vector."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B, in the arity-k relation regime of equation (3) and Section "
+        "2.3: exhaustive relation evaluation costs O(2^(k-1)) exact class-group "
+        "tests after the paper's global-sign symmetry; at the shipping preset "
+        "k=23 it averaged 1,987,246.5 candidates, 13,910,812.5 counted exact "
+        "operations, and 3.42 seconds over eight seeds, while the principal-norm "
+        "invariant recovers the signs in 141 exact arithmetic operations if it "
