codex
I tightened the baseline before finalizing it: for a “find one relation” task, meet-in-the-middle on reduced quadratic-form classes is stronger than the paper’s full \(2^{k-1}\) counting loop. The generator now measures that standard attack instead of an inflated exhaustive baseline, and the shipping arity is raised to 31 so the honest mechanical route is still around a million exact operations while the witness stays short.
