+        "2.3: the paper's count enumerates 2^(k-1) signs, while the standard "
+        "search improvement is meet-in-the-middle on reduced form classes in "
+        "O(2^(k/2) poly(log|D|)) time and memory; at shipping k=31 it averaged "
+        "48,836.5 candidates, 1,237,669.75 counted exact operations, and 0.265 "
