   176	## How to use
   177	
   178	```python
   179	import importlib.util
   180	
   181	path = "results/0902.4670/gen_0902_4670.py"
   182	spec = importlib.util.spec_from_file_location("gen_0902_4670", path)
   183	gen = importlib.util.module_from_spec(spec)
   184	spec.loader.exec_module(gen)
   185	
   186	inst = gen.make_instance(seed=7, **gen.DIFFICULTY[gen.SHIPPING_DIFFICULTY])
   187	question = gen.render(inst)
   188	candidate = gen.parse_answer("<answer>" + str(inst["answer"]).replace(" ", "") + "</answer>")
   189	assert gen.verify(inst, candidate) == (True, "ok")
   190	```
